\newlabel{tab:alarm_rates}{{III}{9}{Descriptive detection comparison at common control-alarm ceilings. Each entry counts detected events out of 96 using lags 0--6. Column headers give attained alarmed-control-update rates, common to all methods, below nominal ceilings of 2\%, 5\% and 10\%}{table.3}{}}
